Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.42,0:00:05.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（游马）可恶～ 第三个心之碎片{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.79,0:00:08.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为什么 为什么！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.64,0:00:12.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为什么拼不上啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.02,0:00:14.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好不容易第三个心之碎片都到手了！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.55,0:00:18.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（小鸟）哪有那么容易就能拼上啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.41,0:00:21.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}心之碎片 每一个都分成了不同的形状{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.11,0:00:24.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}能完美拼合的只有一个而已。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.48,0:00:26.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎～！ 是这样吗！？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.33,0:00:28.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那种东西绝对不可能拼得上嘛！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.86,0:00:30.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（星光体）比起那个，游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.54,0:00:33.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}下次一定要去找持有 No.卡的对手。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.58,0:00:36.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我们参加这场决斗嘉年华{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.77,0:00:38.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是为了回收 No.卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.90,0:00:41.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那是你自己的问题吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.31,0:00:44.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}说到底 你总是动不动就飞上天……
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.91,0:00:52.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}小鸟！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.13,0:00:58.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（安娜）打偏了吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.99,0:01:03.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？ 就算是AR也太有压迫感了吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.03,0:01:06.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不对 游马！ 这是真的！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.68,0:01:07.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.24,0:01:09.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这次一定！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.63,0:01:17.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这边！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.17,0:01:18.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}窜来窜去的！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.50,0:01:20.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}到底怎么回事！？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.04,0:01:23.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}看来是冲着你来的。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.27,0:01:24.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么可能！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.75,0:01:26.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这边 小鸟！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.96,0:01:27.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嗯！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.14,0:01:33.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}敢小看我。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.67,0:01:36.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你以为能从我手里逃得掉吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.77,0:01:46.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧 飞行发射器！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.67,0:02:01.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.95,0:02:06.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}走你 嘿呀～！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.16,0:02:08.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}站住 混蛋～！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.01,0:02:11.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}果然是冲着我们来的！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.04,0:02:13.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}到底是什么人。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.91,0:02:17.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}让开让开让开～！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.78,0:02:20.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}吃我这招！ 哇～！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.98,0:02:22.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这边！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.15,0:02:23.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎！？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.17,0:02:38.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.59,0:02:51.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}都跑到这儿了应该没事了吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.81,0:02:57.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}到此为止了！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.00,0:02:59.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你们已经逃不掉了…。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.58,0:04:38.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那个～。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.24,0:04:41.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不会再让你们逃了。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.96,0:04:44.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}做好觉悟了吗！？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.14,0:04:46.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等 等一下。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.33,0:04:47.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}话说回来这到底是什么情况啊！？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.69,0:04:53.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哼 还是老样子真是不死心啊，九十九游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.24,0:04:55.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你不是安娜！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.62,0:04:56.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}安娜？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.60,0:05:00.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你看，不是有吗，神月安娜。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.13,0:05:02.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}虽然两年前转学了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.55,0:05:04.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}总是跟男生打架{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.85,0:05:07.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}保护被欺负的孩子。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.21,0:05:09.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就是那个安娜啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.32,0:05:11.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}有那种人吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.58,0:05:14.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}既然你不记得那就让我来让你想起来！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.48,0:05:21.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}记得记得！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.00,0:05:23.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我想起来了！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.36,0:05:25.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是，为什么安娜会针对游马！？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.73,0:05:27.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那还用说吗，是复仇啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.58,0:05:29.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（两人）复仇！？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.15,0:05:31.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（安娜）九十九游马！我{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.79,0:05:35.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对你……
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.32,0:05:36.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈～？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.40,0:05:40.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所以说，我对你……。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.37,0:05:42.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}干嘛啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.05,0:05:43.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《难道说安娜她…》
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.91,0:05:45.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所…所以说 我…。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.93,0:05:49.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}到底 搞什么啊～！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.46,0:05:53.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（安娜）在你的鞋子上涂胶水{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.33,0:05:56.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在你的D-pad上乱涂乱画…。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.70,0:06:00.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在你的泳衣上划口子…。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.58,0:06:04.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还在你的饭团里放了石头。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.78,0:06:06.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我说 你也太过分了吧这么过分的事… 呜…。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.64,0:06:09.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊… 说起来～。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.84,0:06:13.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}想起来了啊！ 然后{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.36,0:06:14.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}两年前 我要转学了…。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.89,0:06:17.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所以 我把你叫了出来！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.75,0:06:19.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在转学之前…。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.77,0:06:22.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}想好好地 跟你是为了向你告白啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.33,0:06:29.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可是你却没有来……
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.02,0:06:32.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你明明知道我的心意……
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.45,0:06:41.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（安娜）这份怨恨{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.15,0:06:46.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我一定要讨回来～！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.36,0:06:47.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这算是我最后的仁慈！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.71,0:06:51.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}让你不用受苦我一击就送你上路！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.08,0:06:54.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哇啊～！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.44,0:06:55.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等……等等！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.31,0:06:56.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你的心情我完全明白！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.64,0:06:59.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是那种东西不用也没关系吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.67,0:07:03.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}拜托了……你要是那么想复仇{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.03,0:07:05.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就用决斗来解决吧！！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.05,0:07:05.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈啊！？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.87,0:07:06.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用决斗？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.90,0:07:08.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！你说这种话
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.66,0:07:10.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对方可不是能讲得通的人啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.94,0:07:12.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.36,0:07:13.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎！？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.46,0:07:15.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我来当你的对手！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.49,0:07:17.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}说的就是你……
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.51,0:07:18.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这种事我早就料到可能会有了{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.69,0:07:22.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所以我也开始玩决斗了！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.06,0:07:25.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}莫名其妙……
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.08,0:07:26.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}作为交换，如果我赢了{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.61,0:07:27.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你，就归我了！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.98,0:07:28.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎哎！？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.63,0:07:29.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.40,0:07:32.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗的话我可不会输！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.49,0:07:33.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.06,0:07:36.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（安娜）来决一胜负吧！九十九游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.19,0:07:38.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（两人）决斗盘，设置！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.39,0:07:41.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}D视镜，设置！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.75,0:07:45.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}AR影像，连接完成。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.79,0:07:48.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（两人）决斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.48,0:07:51.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这就是人类的爱情吗……
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.34,0:07:53.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超出了我的理解……
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.89,0:07:57.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}先攻我就拿下了！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.58,0:07:59.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合！抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.94,0:08:03.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我将爆走特急火箭箭特殊召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.71,0:08:13.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呜……呜哇～攻击力5000！？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.91,0:08:17.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这什么怪物啊～！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.27,0:08:20.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一上来就特殊召唤超重量级怪兽……
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.64,0:08:22.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（安娜）这张卡不能通常召唤{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.83,0:08:26.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}只有自己场上没有卡的时候{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.36,0:08:28.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}才能从手牌特殊召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.21,0:08:31.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且每当自己的回合到来{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.41,0:08:33.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}必须将5张手牌送去墓地，否则就会被破坏！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.77,0:08:35.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}5张手牌！？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.08,0:08:37.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}送那么多去墓地的话{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.48,0:08:39.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}手牌马上就会全没了啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.83,0:08:43.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将爆走特急 火箭飞箭特殊召唤的回合{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.20,0:08:44.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我无法进行攻击
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.55,0:08:47.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}只要这张卡在场地上{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.07,0:08:49.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}除此以外的卡都不能盖放！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.43,0:08:51.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}回合结束！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.62,0:08:52.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.11,0:08:53.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从哪边攻过来都行！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.98,0:08:57.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔…我的回合！抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.01,0:08:58.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.52,0:08:59.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.53,0:09:01.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}仅凭这个回合是打不倒火箭飞箭的。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.72,0:09:02.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.21,0:09:04.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那就为下个回合做准备！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.75,0:09:08.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我以里侧守备表示盖放一只怪兽！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.63,0:09:13.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再盖放一张卡，回合结束！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.33,0:09:14.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊～你这家伙要逃吗！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.69,0:09:17.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}才…才不是在逃呢！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.88,0:09:21.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔……！既然如此，那就看着吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.41,0:09:22.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合！抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.93,0:09:28.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我不支付代价破坏火箭箭！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.32,0:09:30.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么可能……！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.34,0:09:35.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我盖上5张卡，回合结束！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.89,0:09:36.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎哎！？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.93,0:09:39.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这次是5张盖牌！？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.93,0:09:43.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且连怪兽都没有完全是毫无防备啊！？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.47,0:09:46.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}到底在想什么……
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.16,0:09:46.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.82,0:09:49.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从哪边攻过来都行！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.35,0:09:50.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嘿呀！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.15,0:09:52.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}想再多也没用！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.22,0:09:53.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合！抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.74,0:09:56.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我召唤轰轰轰巨人！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.15,0:10:04.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用轰轰轰巨人直接攻击！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.85,0:10:08.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这一击要是打中就是2000点的大伤害！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.72,0:10:10.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上啊～！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.91,0:10:11.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等等，游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.84,0:10:13.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那家伙可是有5张盖牌啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.94,0:10:15.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我将自己场上的盖牌{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.80,0:10:18.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}全部破坏！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.83,0:10:19.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.99,0:10:21.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.35,0:10:25.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}除雪机关车哈斯尔拉塞尔特殊召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.22,0:10:28.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡不能通常召唤{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.25,0:10:31.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}当对方发动直接攻击时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.11,0:10:33.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将自己的魔法、陷阱卡
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.09,0:10:34.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}全部破坏{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.31,0:10:38.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就可以从手牌特殊召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.18,0:10:42.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧！除雪机关车 哈斯尔拉塞尔！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.56,0:10:45.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力 2500！？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.92,0:10:47.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哥哥哥巨人的战斗中止！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.95,0:10:51.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哼…怕了吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.31,0:10:52.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那就从这边上吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.83,0:10:58.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}除雪机关车 奋力破雪号的怪兽效果发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.05,0:10:59.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}每破坏一张魔法
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.47,0:11:01.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}陷阱区域的卡{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.75,0:11:04.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就给予２００点伤害！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.44,0:11:07.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}也就是说 ５张就是１０００点！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.56,0:11:17.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.74,0:11:21.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好～！ 首先 是１０００点！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.95,0:11:25.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔… 效果伤害原来是冲着这个来的吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.49,0:11:27.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么回事？ 这场决斗…。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.84,0:11:31.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}乍一看 像是随性而为看似如此{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.04,0:11:33.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}难道说一切都在她的计算之中吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.23,0:11:35.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}小心点 游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.19,0:11:38.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}她的强大 可不是寻常级别。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.62,0:11:39.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}少罗嗦！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.64,0:11:42.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我只是稍微大意了一下而已！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.48,0:11:44.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}回合结束！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.00,0:11:45.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（安娜）好～嘞 上了！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.27,0:11:45.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马…。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.69,0:11:47.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合 抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.90,0:11:53.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动魔法卡 临时钻石！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.30,0:11:59.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡可以从墓地将攻击力3000以上的{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.16,0:12:04.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}机械族怪兽1只以守备表示特殊召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.37,0:12:08.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}复活吧！ 爆走特快火箭箭！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.93,0:12:12.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}又是那只怪兽吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.63,0:12:14.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等级10的怪兽 有2只。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.98,0:12:18.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧 游马！ 我的爆走卡组{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.18,0:12:22.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}有本事的话就来阻止看看啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.22,0:12:24.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我将 等级10的火箭箭和
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.76,0:12:27.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喧嚣拉塞尔 进行叠放！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.79,0:12:30.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用2只怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.09,0:12:32.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}构建叠放网络！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.32,0:12:35.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.51,0:12:36.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.71,0:12:41.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超重型炮塔列车 古斯塔夫最大炮！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.27,0:12:46.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊……啊啊……。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.65,0:12:50.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力 3000！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.17,0:12:54.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且还是阶级10的怪兽超量……。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.03,0:12:57.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就让你们见识见识这家伙的力量！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.40,0:13:01.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动古斯塔夫最大炮的怪兽效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.98,0:13:06.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡1回合1次
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.09,0:13:09.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以通过消耗1个超量素材{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.35,0:13:12.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}给对手造成2000点伤害！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.27,0:13:18.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}变形了！？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.49,0:13:21.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且还有2000点伤害？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.82,0:13:24.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上啊～！古斯塔夫最大炮！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.84,0:13:27.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发射准备完毕 巨型加农炮！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.07,0:13:33.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哇啊～！！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.46,0:13:37.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}成功了！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.56,0:13:40.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}成功了成功了 成功啦～！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.50,0:13:42.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来 生命值就只剩1000了！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.70,0:13:46.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这场决斗 我赢定了！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.06,0:13:50.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}刚才的约定，可别忘了！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.26,0:13:51.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}最后一击！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.20,0:13:54.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我用攻击力3000的古斯塔夫·马克斯{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.98,0:13:58.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击攻击力2000的隆隆隆巨人！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.24,0:14:05.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.76,0:14:07.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.54,0:14:11.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.33,0:14:12.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动陷阱！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.90,0:14:15.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}叠光破坏者！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.25,0:14:16.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}直到战斗阶段结束{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.77,0:14:20.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}场上1只怪兽的攻击力
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.75,0:14:23.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}提升500点！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.67,0:14:26.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（隆隆隆巨人）呜哇～！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.52,0:14:29.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呜哇～！唔！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.05,0:14:31.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啧，回合结束。算你捡回一条命。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.75,0:14:34.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不过下个回合就结束了！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.78,0:14:36.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}该怎么办才好啊……
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.80,0:14:40.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再这样下去，就要挨古斯塔夫·马克斯的效果
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.02,0:14:41.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后输掉了！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.34,0:14:42.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}话虽如此
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.03,0:14:44.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力3000的古斯塔夫最大炮{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.21,0:14:48.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可没那么容易打倒啊…。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.07,0:14:49.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是，有办法。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.59,0:14:52.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嗯？什么啊？办法是指。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.87,0:14:54.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}忘了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.13,0:14:58.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你的新伙伴啊…。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.34,0:14:59.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}新的？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.87,0:15:01.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对了！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.09,0:15:05.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我有新的伙伴啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.08,0:15:08.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合，抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.95,0:15:10.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我召唤唰啪啪骑士！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.98,0:15:15.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（唰啪啪骑士）呜哦～唰啪～！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.51,0:15:20.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再将莱莱德反召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.06,0:15:21.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（莱莱德）莱～！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.59,0:15:26.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我将等级3的唰啪啪骑士和莱莱德
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.51,0:15:27.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}叠放！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.81,0:15:29.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用2只怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.48,0:15:32.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}构建叠放网络！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.35,0:15:33.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.54,0:15:37.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧！我的新伙伴！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.94,0:15:43.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（天甜甜甜咚）天甜 天甜…！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.99,0:15:46.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}太鼓魔人 天甜甜甜咚～！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.32,0:15:49.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈。守备力1000的怪兽？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.02,0:15:52.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}看着吧。太鼓魔人 天甜甜甜咚的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.37,0:15:54.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怪兽效果 发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.24,0:15:55.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.13,0:15:58.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}通过使用1个超量素材{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.28,0:15:59.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将对手的怪兽超量怪兽的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.75,0:16:00.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量素材{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.80,0:16:02.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}全部送去墓地！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.68,0:16:03.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.67,0:16:05.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后 每有1个
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.03,0:16:07.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}送去墓地的超量素材{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.20,0:16:08.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力提升500点！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.48,0:16:09.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈！天甜 天甜…！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.57,0:16:11.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鼓击音波！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.25,0:16:13.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}天甜 天甜…！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.26,0:16:15.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来古斯塔夫最大炮的效果就用不了了！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.62,0:16:18.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且因为有守备表示的 天天天pos在{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.66,0:16:21.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所以战斗伤害也不会受到。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.01,0:16:24.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我 盖放２张卡 回合结束！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.72,0:16:28.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你竟敢… 你竟敢…！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.07,0:16:32.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把我惹火了会有什么后果就让你好好见识一下！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.28,0:16:34.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合 抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.81,0:16:39.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我从手牌发动装备魔法 机关联结！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.69,0:16:41.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将墓地中 等级８以上的{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.71,0:16:45.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}机械族怪兽２只从游戏中除外{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.41,0:16:46.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}装备到机械族怪兽上{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.77,0:16:50.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那只怪兽的攻击力变成２倍！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.98,0:16:54.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.17,0:17:03.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.60,0:17:06.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力６０００！？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.63,0:17:08.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}比火箭箭还高啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.82,0:17:10.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}何等惊人的破坏力！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.84,0:17:14.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}更进一步！由于机关联结的效果{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.37,0:17:17.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}装备怪兽攻击守备怪兽时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.40,0:17:18.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}如果攻击力超过守备力{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.59,0:17:23.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就只按那个差值给对手造成贯通伤害！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.30,0:17:26.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}也就是说 天天天天砰的守备力是
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.45,0:17:28.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}1000，所以…{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.17,0:17:30.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}被攻击的话 就是5000点伤害！？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.54,0:17:33.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来 胜负已定了。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.73,0:17:36.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！你是我的了！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.81,0:17:37.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.61,0:17:37.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.99,0:17:39.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还是说 像那时候一样{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.80,0:17:41.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}向我哭诉求饶？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.71,0:17:43.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哭诉求饶～！？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.50,0:17:47.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就是我拿走你卡的时候！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.20,0:17:51.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂喂！想要回去的话就爬到这里来！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.40,0:17:53.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}求求你了还给我啦～！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.09,0:17:57.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}连树都爬不上去的你还在这儿呜呜哭呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.30,0:17:58.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎！？那也就是说……。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.75,0:18:00.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我做过那种事吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.00,0:18:02.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你还想装傻吗！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.20,0:18:04.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就算你那么说{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.53,0:18:06.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不记得的事我就是不记得啊～！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.23,0:18:08.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那我就让你想起来！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.59,0:18:12.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用６０００点的攻击力！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.29,0:18:12.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.83,0:18:15.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马的生命值是５００。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.31,0:18:18.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}面对那家伙６０００的攻击力竟然还敢迎上去……。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.35,0:18:21.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现在不是佩服的时候！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.03,0:18:25.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是，那会成为她的致命伤。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.47,0:18:26.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.08,0:18:28.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧游马！给她最后一击！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.11,0:18:29.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.80,0:18:32.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上啊！古斯塔夫·马克斯！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.66,0:18:35.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用天天气势攻击！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.74,0:18:36.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.55,0:18:41.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（安娜）古斯塔夫铁锤！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.07,0:18:46.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}陷阱发动！莽撞！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.28,0:18:48.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡在守备怪兽被攻击时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.98,0:18:52.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}变为攻击表示继续战斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.52,0:18:54.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力2200？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.54,0:18:57.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那样的话可打不倒古斯塔夫·马克斯哦！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.74,0:19:00.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就是要打倒给你看！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.26,0:19:03.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一飞冲天啊，我！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.29,0:19:04.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}陷阱发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.80,0:19:07.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}神圣铠甲 镜甲！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.33,0:19:09.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}直到战斗阶段结束成为攻击对象的{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.86,0:19:14.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怪兽的攻击力变得与对方怪兽相同！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.74,0:19:16.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力变得一样了！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.07,0:19:33.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.93,0:19:35.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且 陷阱卡 蛮干是{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.95,0:19:37.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}破坏对方怪兽的时候{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.64,0:19:41.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将破坏的对方怪兽的攻击力数值的伤害{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.68,0:19:44.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}给予对方玩家！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.63,0:19:45.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.72,0:19:48.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧！ 蛮干的效果
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.06,0:19:50.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}造成6000点伤害！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.97,0:19:57.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哇啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.21,0:20:04.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}成功了！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.25,0:20:07.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呼……。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.94,0:20:11.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呜…… 我输了。 居然是我。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.98,0:20:14.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为什么！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.34,0:20:18.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那是因为 你对着生命值500的我{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.20,0:20:21.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用攻击力 6000攻过来了。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.91,0:20:24.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要是不那么做你靠着口香糖的效果{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.78,0:20:27.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}才没受到大伤害。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.97,0:20:31.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可恶！呜……
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.00,0:20:35.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那个……在这种时候虽然有点不合时宜。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.88,0:20:39.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}安娜喜欢的不是游马{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.59,0:20:42.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而是筑根优也君吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.28,0:20:44.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}筑根优也？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.14,0:20:47.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊，这么说来确实有那么个人。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.16,0:20:50.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}总是被弄哭然后去办公室……
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.22,0:20:55.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}筑根：呜～嗯。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.41,0:20:56.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.60,0:20:59.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还给我啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.96,0:21:03.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊……
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.49,0:21:06.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你的名字太容易搞混了！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.18,0:21:09.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嘛，今天就这样吧这次就饶了你吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.74,0:21:12.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.09,0:21:13.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}话说回来，心之碎片呢！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.77,0:21:15.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}心之碎片？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.79,0:21:18.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你都输了，就给我留下！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.65,0:21:20.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你在说什么啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.43,0:21:21.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎，你……
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.85,0:21:23.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你不是参加了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.11,0:21:24.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗嘉年华吗！？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.88,0:21:28.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那种东西谁会参加啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.92,0:21:33.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那你倒是一开始就说啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.12,0:21:35.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真是个让人头疼的家伙！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.81,0:21:38.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不过我就觉得奇怪了。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.51,0:21:41.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}居然会有女孩子喜欢游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.23,0:21:43.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈！？你说什么！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.05,0:21:45.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不过，有点可惜啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.21,0:21:45.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.75,0:21:49.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那场破天荒的决斗我还想再看一次。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.12,0:21:53.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈？那种家伙随他去啦再也别来了！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.15,0:21:55.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嗯嗯。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.54,0:22:01.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}九十九游马吗… 呵呵。
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.95,0:22:08.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}给我记住了 九十九游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.84,0:24:13.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马啊 你的决斗水平 还真是一点长进都没有呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.52,0:24:14.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你在说什么啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.54,0:24:17.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我可是变得超级强了！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.90,0:24:19.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那就 拿出证据给我看看。
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.88,0:24:20.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好～！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.43,0:24:23.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我 通常召唤希望皇霍普！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.13,0:24:24.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从那里开始啊！

